@startuml 15-Admin-Monitoring
title Luồng 15: Admin - Cấu hình + Giám sát hệ thống

actor "Admin" as A15
participant "Browser\n(admin.html)" as Browser15
participant "Flask\n(admin.py)" as Flask15
participant "DB\n(SQLAlchemy)" as DB15
participant "Log Files\n(logs/)" as Logs15

' Site Settings
A15 -> Browser15: Chỉnh worthy_threshold = 8.0
Browser15 -> Flask15: POST /dev/settings?secret=<TOKEN>\n{ guest_load_more: true, worthy_threshold: 8.0 }

Flask15 -> DB15: SiteSettings.query.get(1)
DB15 --> Flask15: SiteSettings object
Flask15 -> DB15: cfg.guest_load_more = true\ncfg.worthy_threshold = 8.0
DB15 -> DB15: UPDATE site_settings
Flask15 -> DB15: db.session.commit()

Flask15 --> Browser15: JSON { success: true, message: "Đã lưu cấu hình." }
Browser15 --> A15: Hiển thị "Đã lưu cấu hình"

' Fetch History
A15 -> Browser15: Click tab "Lịch sử Fetch"
Browser15 -> Flask15: GET /dev/fetch-history?secret=<TOKEN>&limit=20

Flask15 -> DB15: FetchHistory.query\n.order_by(started_at.desc()).limit(20)
DB15 --> Flask15: [FetchHistory records]

Flask15 --> Browser15: JSON { records: [{id, started_at,\nduration, saved_count, ai_processed, status}, ...] }
Browser15 --> A15: Hiển thị bảng lịch sử fetch

' System Status
A15 -> Browser15: Click tab "Trạng thái"
Browser15 -> Flask15: GET /dev/status?secret=<TOKEN>

Flask15 -> DB15: SchedulerState.query.get(1)
DB15 --> Flask15: last_run = 2026-06-07T09:00:00
Flask15 -> DB15: Paper.query.filter_by(status='pending').count()
DB15 --> Flask15: pending_count = 3

Flask15 --> Browser15: JSON { last_run, pending_count }
Browser15 --> A15: Hiển thị trạng thái:\nLần fetch cuối + Số bài pending

' View Logs
A15 -> Browser15: Click tab "Log"
Browser15 -> Flask15: GET /dev/logs?secret=<TOKEN>&lines=100&level=ERROR

Flask15 -> Logs15: read_log_file(app.log, 100 lines)
Logs15 --> Flask15: [log lines]
Flask15 -> Flask15: Filter theo level ERROR

Flask15 --> Browser15: JSON { stats, lines: [...], filter: "ERROR" }
Browser15 --> A15: Hiển thị log đã lọc

' Cron Log
A15 -> Browser15: Click tab "Cron Log"
Browser15 -> Flask15: GET /dev/cron-log?secret=<TOKEN>&lines=50

Flask15 -> Logs15: read_log_file(logs/cron.log, 50 lines)
Logs15 --> Flask15: [cron log lines]

Flask15 --> Browser15: JSON { stats, lines: [...] }
Browser15 --> A15: Hiển thị log của cron job

@enduml